{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>To shedim, not Eloah.</b> For they are not eternal, as the Sages of blessed memory said concerning the shedim — that they die like human beings (Hagigah 16a)." "<b>Elohim they did not know — newcomers that recently came.</b> When they saw some species of existent whose existence they had not previously known, they would suppose that it had some prior proximate cause unique to it, and they would worship it."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:05.341369206Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}